{
  "$comment": "The single source of truth for which detectors exist. Capability declarations are GENERATED from this file (tools/capabilities.mjs), never hand-written, and tools/validate-schemas.mjs rejects any detector id used in a result that is absent here. §14.1 requires each format adapter to declare exact capabilities; a hand-maintained capability list would drift from the detectors actually registered, and the drift would look like a correct declaration.",
