      ],
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "not_implemented",
      "waitingOn": "#5"
    }
  },
  "$parsersComment": "The readers that parse each format, registered alongside the detectors that consume them. §14.1 requires parser versions to be visible in results, which means a result naming a parser must name one that exists. Every entry is not_implemented for the same reason the detectors are."
}
